      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u00abcore/game\u00bb  Game \u00b7 Snapshot \u00b7 Stats \u00b7 Timer \u00b7 Confirmation \u00b7 Target\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nGame: -cfg Config -state state -timer Timer -confirm Confirmation\n      -throttle movement.Throttler -processes []process.Info -targets []*Target \u00b7 Stats\n      +New(processes,cfg) *Game +Start(w,h) +State() +IsRunning() +Stop()\n      +Targets() +Speed() +Throttle() +TimeLimit() +TimeLeft()\n      +ConfirmTarget() +Confirm() +Snapshot() +Update(w,h) +Kill(t)\nStats: +Kills() +FreedMem() +HighScore() +SetHighScore() +RecordKill(rss)\nTimer: +Start() +Expired() +Remaining() +SecondsLeft() +LimitSeconds()\nConfirmation: +Pending() +Request(t) +Accept() +Cancel()   implements Confirmer\nTarget: embeds process.Info + movement.Motion \u00b7 State TargetState\n        +Tag() +Update() +IsDead()/IsAlive()/IsKilling() +IsHitAt() +Kill() +Snapshot()",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u00abcore/game\u00bb  Game \u00b7 Snapshot \u00b7 Stats \u00b7 Timer \u00b7 Confirmation \u00b7 Target\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nGame: -cfg Config -state state -timer Timer -confirm Confirmation\n      -throttle movement.Throttler -processes []process.Info -targets []*Target \u00b7 Stats\n      +New(processes,cfg) *Game +Start(w,h) +State() +IsRunning() +Stop()\n      +Targets() +Speed() +Throttle() +TimeLimit() +TimeLeft()\n      +ConfirmTarget() +Confirm() +Snapshot() +Update(w,h) +Kill(t)\nStats: +Kills() +FreedMem() +HighScore() +SetHighScore() +RecordKill(rss)\nTimer: +Start() +Expired() +Remaining() +SecondsLeft() +LimitSeconds()\nConfirmation: +Pending() +Request(t) +Accept() +Cancel()   implements Confirmer\nTarget: embeds process.Info + movement.Motion \u00b7 State TargetState\n        +Tag() +Update() +IsDead()/IsAlive()/IsKilling() +IsHitAt() +Kill() +Snapshot()",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
